(a) whether it is a fact that the Ministry has launched a two year Mahatma Gandhi National Fellowship Certificate Programme in Public Policy and Management in collaboration with nine Indian Institutes of Management (IIMs);
(b) if so, the details thereof;
(c) the aim of the Ministry in launching this programme and  how many fellowships will be awarded ; and
(d) the post certification avenues available to the fellows and whether Government plans to induct them as professional interns/consultants within the State/district level organisational setup?

(a)	 whether Government has taken note of the crisis in the Cashew industry in Koraput district of Odisha;
(b)	whether Government proposes to introduce a comprehensive scheme for the protection of Cashew industry and if so, details thereof along with the action taken by Government in this regard; 
(c)	whether it has come to the notice of Government that Cashew industries in the State of Odisha have been closed due to non-availability of raw Cashew nuts; and
(d)	if so, the details thereof and the action taken by Government to ensure availability of sufficient quantity of raw Cashew nuts to these industries?

